      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dan Feng the sinner, embracing immorality and breaking the ban,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "thieving immortality and inciting riot."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Both gods and man alike are enraged, such that none can grant repentance,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It is only right to execute justice and punish the guilty, in order to uphold order and peace."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-046fb7db27bac648"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "However,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Taking into account his past merits, he shall be spared a heavy punishment,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Through molting shall he atone for his faults."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A never-ending exile far beyond public opinion."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "With total interception across the whole dominion."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e51b541ce16c1992"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
